	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 17th level, your name is well known among the wicked and the cruel. With 8 hours of preparation you can call forth four @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-monsters.Actor.h7t7p23al4a9iehw]{Squads of Soldiers} lead by a @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-monsters.Actor.1vmzz79hissbe6ep]{Blackguard}. These soldiers will follow your commands for up to an hour before returning to their own machinations, killing any you set them upon with wild abandon. Only usable in a populated area.</p><p>With narrator’s permission these may be undead.</p>",
